WEBVTT

00:05:29.575 --> 00:05:30.868
and the Bob Ross ...

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.286
would be so life-changing.

00:05:32.328 --> 00:05:35.831
(Laughter)

00:05:35.873 --> 00:05:38.959
So, I've been a student
of dance for 42 years.

00:05:39.001 --> 00:05:42.588
My relationship with the art form
runs deep and quite intimate.

00:05:43.172 --> 00:05:44.965
This helped me through trauma,

00:05:45.007 --> 00:05:46.384
it has paid my rent,

00:05:46.425 --> 00:05:50.012
but most of all, it's been
an unfaltering joy in my life.

00:05:50.888 --> 00:05:52.306
And that's why I'm here.

00:05:52.348 --> 00:05:54.725
Because I believe
there's more joy for you,

00:05:54.725 --> 00:05:56.227
only steps away,

00:05:57.269 --> 00:05:59.605
via simple and rudimentary moves